Phase 5 – HTML generation:
  ✔ 5.1 resources/views/auditions/notice.blade.php: plain page modeled on the Love… or Best Offer flyer (the ACT logo is already in the site header, so not repeated) @done(26-11-16 14:27)
  ✔ 5.1a App\Support\PosterPalette: plain page colored from the poster (GD thumbnail → color buckets → dark / accent / banner highlight / tint, each forced to WCAG contrast); yellow never the accent (turns olive), accent re-picked if it matches the dark color; default black/red when the poster has no vivid color. Checked against all 33 posters (~14 ms each) @done(26-11-16 15:10)
  ✔ 5.2 App\Services\GeminiAuditionGenerator: plain page + facts JSON + poster (base64) → themed HTML @done(26-11-16 14:27)
    - 429/500/502/503/504 or timeout: retry once after 5s, then the fallback model, then "busy" (Notify offers "Build without AI")
    - runs after the POST's response (litespeed_finish_request on the host) so slow 503s can't time the request out; page polls every 4s, result cached 30 min
    - output cleaned: code fences, scripts, on… attributes, iframes/forms, @import, indentation removed
  ✔ 5.3 Verified locally: save/upsert/delete of child rows, defaults stored as null, plain + AI generation end-to-end over HTTP (AI via fallback model) @done(26-11-16 14:27)
  ☐ 5.4 Verify on production: "Build with AI" returns at once and finishes via polling (proves LiteSpeed early finish); run the migration

